  "_about": "Klive's translation glossary (LOCALIZATION_PLAN §8). Seeded by AI from the English catalogs; each language column still needs review by a native speaker. Translators and the AI follow it; extend it in the same change that adds or fixes a language. See README.md. The first translation round (LOCALIZATION_PLAN step 10) added the terms its translators had to settle on themselves.",
